</div>

<p>All supporting documents—pickup photos, LR bilty, inspection checklist, and signed sign‑off—are scanned and uploaded to the cloud‑based delivery portal within 24 hours. This digital archive ensures quick retrieval in case of disputes, insurance claims, or future resale verification.</p>
<p>By adhering to this structured handover protocol, both parties gain confidence that the two‑wheeler has been transported safely, without hidden damage, and that the recorded mileage accurately reflects its journey.</p></div>
